{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6ca4fef646e98923e8958549bcd038d3a11e7a90ad187d9a03ffb70113dd5ede", "ja": "（今日はBOT連動ドラマの宣伝も兼ねて、TV番組に\n出演する。ロコの準備は終わったかな……）", "zh": "（今天要参加电视节目，顺便宣传BOT联动电视剧。ROCO的准备工作已经结束了吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "0a0502a21d7d815a503686c483b4e05556bd9b97cd7431ff1a25b1d9c721f8b9", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nお待たせです……うぅ。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n让你久等了……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e1075af3e27902aa465769967fa922db32daaec22363bb1fc045ad29cd268d30", "ja": "あれっ、ロコ、どうしたんだ？\nなんかヨレヨレだな。", "zh": "咦，ROCO，你这是怎么了？\n看起来无精打采的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "abe83ead61f72b94509fe6ffff1b583ced2e53ab49b1791825560332195251ae", "ja": "それが……タカネとチヅルが、\nオーバープロテクトなんです～！", "zh": "那个……贵音和千鹤她们，保护过度啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1004_p", "source_sha256": "416830c52f02637a69b3104d43e040b9baae6cd13c9b07af55e458655a06b475", "ja": "オーバー……？　あ、もしかして\n過保護って意味か？", "zh": "过度……？啊，难道是指过度保护？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "af2c098999c17534ea526e234de117ba1e20d07d3dc87e347f740086af9b9c0c", "ja": "イグザクトリーです……！　ソングのレッスンも、\nダンスでも、ランチの時も……うぅ。", "zh": "没错……！歌曲课、舞蹈课，还有吃午饭的时候……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "e33137bef03ca15fb7401a82ffc9c4ba531fda188dd26d3289a7e49a1293d3ea", "ja": "レフトとライトからサンドされて、ロコは……。\nロコは……。", "zh": "被左右夹在中间，ROCO就……。  \nROCO就……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8bc40d93169c93ab283d1e13081f8ac056aa506502b96f6c0cd722a560b63fc6", "ja": "なるほど……ロコとしては、イヤなのか？", "zh": "原来如此……作为ROCO来说，你是不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "2ef2418926719082629bbbdfce3bcac37662c234e58581f3fcaf4e78113f4746", "ja": "イヤというほどではないから、困るんです～。\nタカネもチヅルも、悪気はないのはわかりますし……。", "zh": "还没到讨厌的程度，所以才为难啊～。\n我知道贵音和千鹤也没有恶意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "62cf69eec2cf656fdbc1f3780a489a55433bb80c01dd9c6db964a4fd689d7111", "ja": "でもパブリック・ビューのあるところでは、\nちょっと恥ずかしいです。小さい子みたいですし……。", "zh": "不过，在有公共大屏的地方，还是有点害羞。感觉就像个小孩子一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1010_p", "source_sha256": "06f6e3b9b5e9aba3aaed1e8bb578bc7e362c402c94507f00c2c4cd7ebbcfa999", "ja": "うーん、そうか……\nこっちから、それとなく注意しておこうか？", "zh": "嗯——这样啊……\n要不要我这边不动声色地提醒一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "ad9b39cc5ddb07963732b9add8b520634470a6303fb39777dec8aba7f8e87bf6", "ja": "{$P$}がですか？\nでも、それは……う～ん。", "zh": "是{$P$}吗？\n可是，那……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "ef801c527526dd410109952a807abeb2c875c15d1137f45fb420a667d4a79992", "ja": "ノープロブレムです！　ふたりとも、\nロコのためにやってくれているんでしょうし……。", "zh": "没问题！你们两位也是为了ROCO才这么做的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1edbd1be18e73b96fd08175de736385dd80ceed32f04948adefe256d6e87ab19", "ja": "でも、そんなにヨレヨレになってしまうなら、\nやっぱり言った方が……。", "zh": "不过，如果都变得这么憔悴了，果然还是应该说出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "570a5e3e2691ff5bb99cdb85dff3188fd19d8698fce67863e671b3fb93f2029c", "ja": "{$P$}……。{$P$}\nまで、オーバープロテクトですか？", "zh": "{$P$}……。连{$P$}都要过度保护吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e26a414638e42cfae60998de35c1012017cd9e3cb073077288cf0cb42e925f61", "ja": "うっ……確かに、言われてみればそうかも。", "zh": "呃……仔细想想，好像确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "c4dbeaf5546eda6670ced44f8fd250e822984db522cc8ecb43353827b0013815", "ja": "大丈夫です！　次にまた\nお世話されそうになったら、ちゃんと断ります！", "zh": "没关系的！下次要是又\n快要被照顾的话，萝子一定会好好拒绝的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0583_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "2afb3bd29f1e17692548b34ab5fe5910ebe4bdca0a4735e2b73182f5192850c7", "ja": "ロコは小さい子じゃないですし、\nふたりとは仲間……フレンドですからね！", "zh": "ROCO已经不是小孩子了，而且我们和那两位是伙伴……朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
